msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷は――⟪k:1⟫一体、⟪k:2⟫どちらの方角だったのでしょう？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_3990E263_69AA_4FC5_88B9_662FEA8F802B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df8cd439d7f0932cf3a69c3d71a9db6ee9caf6526993fcd778a9504807d6b8b5
