#: scenario2:scenario2_661D5D51_C0CA_4BD0_AC8A_2B5045A5B24B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 519493c1c567e906ac5152ab97d43bd6166681c6c991a6a8bbc7deb50342939d
